flowchart TD
    A[Start console runner] --> B[Load appsettings.json]
    B --> C[Apply command-line overrides]
    C --> D[Read config, request, and response worksheets]
    D --> E{Workbook valid?}
    E -- No --> X[Write fatal error and exit 1]
    E -- Yes --> F[Resolve testcase and data-ID selections]
    F --> G[Resolve environments]
    G --> H[Create testcase/environment run]
    H --> I[For each data row, thread, and iteration]
    I --> J[Select step variables]
    J --> K[Merge environment and correlation values]
    K --> L{Step type}
    L -- HTTP --> M[Render template and send HTTP request]
    L -- GraphQL --> N[Build GraphQL POST and send request]
    L -- SQL --> O[Run SQL Server command]
    L -- File --> P[Read or write workspace file]
    L -- Script --> Q[Run trusted C# script]
    M --> R[Record result]
    N --> R
    O --> R
    P --> R
    Q --> R
    R --> S[Evaluate assertions when applicable]
    S --> T[Publish outputs and correlations]
    T --> U{Failed and stopOnFailure?}
    U -- Yes --> V[Skip remaining steps]
    U -- No --> W{More steps?}
    V --> Y[Write history, logs, and events]
    W -- Yes --> J
    W -- No --> Y
    Y --> Z{More runs?}
    Z -- Yes --> I
    Z -- No --> AA[Move result to pass or failed folder]
    AA --> AB[Return 0, 1, or 2]
